<title>CANADA: Couche-Tard extends Silcorp offer.</title>
<headline>Couche-Tard extends Silcorp offer.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alimentation Couche Tard Inc said a subsidiary was extending its bid to acquire all the shares of Silcorp Ltd until October 21.</p>
<p>Couch Tard says the original offer remains unchanged in all other respects.</p>
</text>
